<p><sup><a href="#ftnref2" id="ftn2">2</a></sup> Federal Open Market Committee (2023). The quarterly Summary of Economic Projections presents FOMC participants’ forecasts of key economic variables over the next three to four years and for the longer run.</p>
<p><sup><a href="#ftnref3" id="ftn3">3</a></sup> Federal Open Market Committee (2022).</p>
<p><sup><a href="#ftnref4" id="ftn4">4</a></sup> Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (2023).</p>
<p><sup><a href="#ftnref5" id="ftn5">5</a></sup> Further details about the Federal Reserve’s <cite>Senior Loan Officer Opinion Survey on Banking Lending Practices</cite> are <a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/data/sloos.htm">available online</a>.</p>


